WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.165
Week 5: Location, Condition, and Existence. locate a place describe a temporary condition say what is available

2
00:00:08.165 --> 00:00:16.052
Form and meaning. Estar for location and condition; hay for existence; ser versus estar; basic prepositions.

3
00:00:16.052 --> 00:00:39.921
Model set. La farmacia está cerca de la plaza. Hay un banco delante del hotel. El museo está cerrado hoy. ¿Dónde están los baños? La reunión es en la sala azul. The pharmacy is near the plaza. There is a bank in front of the hotel. The museum is closed today. Where are the restrooms? The meeting is in the blue room.

4
00:00:39.921 --> 00:00:50.072
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:50.072 --> 00:01:02.442
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: locate a place; describe a temporary condition; say what is available. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:02.442 --> 00:01:27.100
Model language. La farmacia está cerca de la plaza. — The pharmacy is near the plaza. Hay un banco delante del hotel. — There is a bank in front of the hotel. El museo está cerrado hoy. — The museum is closed today. ¿Dónde están los baños? — Where are the restrooms? La reunión es en la sala azul. — The meeting is in the blue room.

7
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:36.998
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
